href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Croatie\" title=\"Croatie\">croate</a>.</strong>\n</p>\n<div class=\"nomobile\">\nVous pouvez partager vos connaissances en l\u2019am\u00e9liorant (<b><a href=\"/wiki/Aide:Comment_modifier_une_page\" title=\"Aide:Comment modifier une page\">comment&#160;?</a></b>) selon les recommandations des <a href=\"/wiki/Projet:Accueil\" title=\"Projet:Accueil\">projets correspondants</a>.</div>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<table class=\"infobox&#95;v2 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"entete basket-ball\" style=\"background-color:#DD8F56;color:#000000;\">Luka \u0160amani\u0107<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r226939240\">.mw-parser-output .entete.basket-ball{background-image:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Picto_Infobox_Basketball.png\")}</style>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87_99_Saski_Baskonia_Euroleague_20250326_(1).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Image illustrative de l\u2019article Luka \u0160amani\u0107\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87_99_Saski_Baskonia_Euroleague_20250326_%281%29.jpg/330px-Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87_99_Saski_Baskonia_Euroleague_20250326_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"280\" height=\"420\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87_99_Saski_Baskonia_Euroleague_20250326_%281%29.jpg/960px-Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87_99_Saski_Baskonia_Euroleague_20250326_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"5152\" data-file-height=\"7728\" /></a></span> <br />Luka \u0160amani\u0107 en 2025\n   </td></tr>\n   <tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Fiche d\u2019identit\u00e9</th></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Nationalit\u00e9\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"datasortkey\" data-sort-value=\"Croatie\"><span class=\"flagicon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-image-border noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Flag_of_Croatia.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Drapeau de la Croatie\"><img alt=\"Drapeau de la Croatie\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Flag_of_Croatia.svg/20px-Flag_of_Croatia.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Flag_of_Croatia.svg/40px-Flag_of_Croatia.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"600\" /></a></span> </span><a href=\"/wiki/Croatie\" title=\"Croatie\">Croatie</a></span>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Naissance\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"2000-01-09\" data-sort-value=\"2000-01-09\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_janvier_en_sport\" title=\"9 janvier en sport\">9 janvier</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2000_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2000 en basket-ball\">2000</a></time><span class=\"noprint\"> (26&#160;ans)</span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Zagreb\" title=\"Zagreb\">Zagreb</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Croatie\" title=\"Croatie\">Croatie</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Taille\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">2,11&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/M%C3%A8tre\" title=\"M\u00e8tre\">m</a> (6<a href=\"/wiki/Pied_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Pied (unit\u00e9)\">\u2032</a>&#160;11<a href=\"/wiki/Pouce_(unit%C3%A9)\" title=\"Pouce (unit\u00e9)\">\u2033</a>)\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Poids\n</th>\n<td colspan