cks_de_New_York\" title=\"Knicks de New York\">Knicks de New York</a><br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Pr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0\">\u2192</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_Westchester\" title=\"Knicks de Westchester\">Knicks de Westchester</a></span><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Celtics_du_Maine\" title=\"Celtics du Maine\">Celtics du Maine</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Jazz_de_l%27Utah\" title=\"Jazz de l&#39;Utah\">Jazz de l'Utah</a><br />Jazz de l'Utah<br /><a href=\"/wiki/Cibona_Zagreb\" title=\"Cibona Zagreb\">Cibona Zagreb</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Saski_Baskonia\" title=\"Saski Baskonia\">Saski Baskonia</a><br />Saski Baskonia<br /><span class=\"nowrap\"><a href=\"/wiki/Z%C3%A9nith_Saint-P%C3%A9tersbourg_(basket-ball)\" title=\"Z\u00e9nith Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg (basket-ball)\">Z\u00e9nith Saint-P\u00e9tersbourg</a></span></td><td valign=\"top\"><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,1<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>7,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>5,3<br />15,2<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>3,7<br />21,8<br /><abbr title=\"N&#39;a pas jou\u00e9\">DNP</abbr><br />27,6<br />21,5<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>9,9<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>4,1<br />10,8<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>6,7<br />19,0<br /><s style=\"visibility:hidden;color:transparent\">0</s>-</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<td colspan=\"3\"><hr style=\"height:2px; color:inherit; background-color:#DD8F56;\" /></td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#555555;\"><small>* Points marqu\u00e9s dans chaque club dans le cadre de la saison r\u00e9guli\u00e8re du championnat national.</small></td>\n</tr><tr>\n\n<td class=\"navigation-only\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: 2px #DD8F56 solid; font-size: 80%; background:inherit; color: inherit; text-align: right;\"><span class=\"plainlinks\" style=\"float:left;\"><a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\" href=\"https://fr.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=0\"><span class=\"infodoc\">modifier</span></a></span>&#160;<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mod%C3%A8le:Infobox_Joueur_de_basket-ball\" title=\"Consultez la documentation du mod\u00e8le\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/40px-Info_Simple.svg.png?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Luka \u0160amani\u0107</b>, n\u00e9 le <time class=\"nowrap date-lien bday\" datetime=\"2000-01-09\" data-sort-value=\"2000-01-09\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_janvier_en_sport\" title=\"9 janvier en sport\">9 janvier</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2000_en_basket-ball\" title=\"2000 en basket-ball\">2000</a></time> \u00e0 <a href=\"/wiki/Zagreb\" title=\"Zagreb\">Zagreb</a> en <a href=\"/wiki/Croatie\" title=\"Croatie\">Croatie</a>, est un joueur <a href=\"/wiki/Croatie\" title=\"Croatie\">croate</a> de <a href=\"/wiki/Basket-ball\" title=\"Basket-ball\">basket-ball</a> \u00e9voluant au poste d'<a href=\"/wiki/Ailier_fort\" title=\"Ailier fort\">ailier fort</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Carri\u00e8re\"><span id=\"Carri.C3.A8re\"></span>Carri\u00e8re</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Carri\u00e8re\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Carri\u00e8re\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Spurs_de_San_Antonio_(2019-2021)\"><span id=\"Spurs_de_San_Antonio_.282019-2021.29\"></span>Spurs de San Antonio (2019-2021)</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Spurs de San Antonio (2019-2021)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Spurs de San Antonio (2019-2021)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Lors de la <a href=\"/wiki/Draft_2019_de_la_NBA\" title=\"Draft 2019 de la NBA\">draft 2019</a> il est s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9 en <abbr class=\"abbr\" title=\"Dix-neuvi\u00e8me\">19<sup>e</sup></abbr> position par les <a href=\"/wiki/Spurs_de_San_Antonio\" title=\"Spurs de San Antonio\">Spurs de San Antonio</a>. Il y signe ensuite un contrat d\u00e9but <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2019-07\" data-sort-value=\"2019-07\">juillet 2019</time><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Samani\u0107 est licenci\u00e9 en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-10\" data-sort-value=\"2021-10\">octobre 2021</time><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Knicks_de_New_York_(2021-2022)\"><span id=\"Knicks_de_New_York_.282021-2022.29\"></span>Knicks de New York (2021-2022)</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Knicks de New York (2021-2022)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Knicks de New York (2021-2022)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>En <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2021-10\" data-sort-value=\"2021-10\">octobre 2021</time>, \u0160amani\u0107 s'engage avec les <a href=\"/wiki/Knicks_de_New_York\" title=\"Knicks de New York\">Knicks de New York</a> en signant un contrat <span class=\"lang-en\" lang=\"en\">two-way</span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. Il joue 7 fois avec les Knicks de Westchester, l'\u00e9quipe de G-League affili\u00e9e aux Knicks de New York, mais jamais avec les Knicks de New York. Il est licenci\u00e9 en <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2022-03\" data-sort-value=\"2022-03\">mars 2022</time><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Jazz_de_l'Utah_(mars_2023-avril_2024)\"><span id=\"Jazz_de_l.27Utah_.28mars_2023-avril_2024.29\"></span>Jazz de l'Utah (mars 2023-avril 2024)</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Jazz de l&#039;Utah (mars 2023-avril 2024)\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Jazz de l&#039;Utah (mars 2023-avril 2024)\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>Fin <time class=\"nowrap\" datetime=\"2023-03\" data-sort-value=\"2023-03\">mars 2023</time>, il signe un contrat de 10 jours au <a href=\"/wiki/Jazz_de_l%27Utah\" title=\"Jazz de l&#39;Utah\">Jazz de l'Utah</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>. \u00c0 l'issue de ce contrat, il signe un nouveau contrat d'une saison partiellement garanti<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Statistiques\">Statistiques</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier la section\u202f: Statistiques\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>modifier</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Luka_%C5%A0amani%C4%87&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Modifier le code source de la section : Statistiques\"><span>modifier le code</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Professionnelles\">Professionnel